invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont_division.h
catches: rsa_equiv_test_blocks
reason: add_modulus_blocks drops the carry out of a block's second chain,
  the chain that adds the carry from the block below. That chain carries
  out only when the four words' sum is all ones, which no random
  remainder meets. bin/rsa_equiv_test_blocks holds one signature under
  the all-ones modulus whose first step adds the modulus back to four
  zero words above a word that is not zero, and its bytes then differ
  from the 32-bit arm's.

--- old
        carry = high + (uint64_t)(sum >> 64);
    }
    return carry;
--- new
        carry = high;
    }
    return carry;
